    "measurementTechnique": [
      "All code used to product this dataset is documented in: https://github.com/COMPASS-DOE/sensor-data-pipeline",
      "First, data are converted to their final output units, based on a central table that specifies, for each datalogger variable, its input units, output units, and conversion factor.",
      "Second, values are flagged when they fall outside of \u2018instrumental bounds\u2019\u2014i.e., the range over which a manufacturer reports that a sensor is calibrated (if that is not available, an expert-defined range).",
      "Third, values are flagged when they fall inside of instrument maintenance windows, as defined in a table that is maintained by field technicians and read by the L1 processor. Fourth, data are regrouped into site-year folders (e.g., \u201cMSM_2023\u201d for Moneystump Marsh 2023 data), and written to monthly files.",
      "Finally, metadata is written into the same site-month folder."
    ],
